{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21971","headline":"夏旱 · 白居易","name":"夏旱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太阴不离毕，太岁仍在午。\n旱日与炎风，枯燋我田亩。\n金石欲销铄，况兹禾与黍。\n嗸嗸万族中，唯农最辛苦。\n悯然望岁者，出门何所覩。\n但见棘与茨，罗生徧场圃。\n恶苗承沴气，欣然得其所。\n感此因问天，可能长不雨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21971.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21971","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}